## Registration Flow

1. User submits registration form.
2. Validate input on the client.
3. Validate again on the server.
4. Register using Supabase Auth.
5. Store full_name and workspace_name as signup metadata.
6. Database trigger provisions the profile and workspace.
7. Assign Tenant Admin membership to the workspace owner.
8. Send email confirmation.
9. Show confirmation-required screen.
10. After confirmation, establish the authenticated session and redirect to /dashboard.

Never accept global_role or workspace_role from user-submitted metadata.

The initial role must be assigned by trusted database logic.

# 6. GOOGLE OAUTH

